---If set to `true`, the available power output is based on the [FluidPrototype::fuel\_value](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/FluidPrototype.html%23fuel_value#fuel_value). Otherwise, the available power output will be based on the fluid temperature and [FluidPrototype::heat\_capacity](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/FluidPrototype.html%23heat_capacity#heat_capacity): `energy = fluid_amount * fluid_temperature * fluid_heat_capacity * effectivity`
---
